The  driver  supports  the  Serverworks  K2,  Frodo4,  Frodo8 and
HT‐1000 Serial ATA controllers, and provides the  interface  with
the  hardware  for the driver.  The 0x0002 flag forces the driver
to disable DMA on chipsets for which DMA would  normally  be  en‐
abled.   This  can  be used as a debugging aid, or to work around
problems where the SATA controller is wired up to the system  in‐
correctly.
